          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dee-bid rɛy ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ca̱r kɛ rɛy lɔacdɛ i̱, “Bä dhil li̱w cäŋ kɛl kɛ tet Thɔɔl. Thilɛ mi bi gɔaa kɛ ɣä ɛ ni ɣöö bä rɔ lɛ̱̈ny ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. Bi Thɔɔl go̱rä cu päl rɛy I-thɛ-rɛl, bä rɔ bar kä jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dee-bid jiɛɛn kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ ti kur bäkɛl, cukɛ ben kä A-kic gat Ma-ɣok kuäär Gɛ̈th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ cieŋ kɛɛl kɛ A-kic kä Gɛ̈th, jɛn kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ, kɛ ji̱ gɔalikiɛn, kɛ Dee-bid kɛnɛ mänkɛ da̱ŋ rɛw, Ä-ɣi-no-am kä Yidh-rɛɛl kɛnɛ Ä-bi-ga-yil kä Kar-mɛl mëë la ciek Na-bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca la̱r Thɔɔl i̱ ci Dee-bid rɔ bar kä Gɛ̈th, /kenɛ jɛ lɛ nyɔk kɛ go̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid A-kic jiök i̱, “Mi jekä gɔɔy kä ji̱, ɛŋu ci ɣä moc kɛ wec ɔ rɛy wi̱i̱niku mi dëë cieŋ thi̱n. Kɛ ɣöö /cä dëë cieŋ wi̱c kuäärä min ti thi̱n?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu A-kic ɛ ka̱m Dhik-lag, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ɛ jɛn cu Dhik-lag cua̱ wec kua̱r Juda mäni walɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid cieŋ wi̱c ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kɛ ruɔ̱n wi̱cdɛ päth ŋuaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ pek ɛ mɔ Dee-bid kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ la ji̱ Gɛ-cur kɛnɛ ji̱ Gɛra kɛ ji̱ Ä-ma-lek, tëë ciaŋkɛ mun in tɛmɛ nikä Cur a räth ni kä I-jëp wa̱a̱ mäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid kɛ näk, wutni kɛnɛ män thilɛ mi cuɛ päl a tëk, kä cuɛ ɣɔ̱k, kɛ det kɛ muɔ̱li, kɛ thɔ̱a̱rɔa̱a̱li, kɛ bieyni pɛ̈c, kä cuɛ luny kä A-kic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci A-kic ɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ winith ci pɛc ɛn walɛ mɔ?” Cu Dee-bid ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ rɛy dɔaar Juda.” Kiɛ, “Ɛ wec ji̱ Yɛ-ra̱-mel.” Kiɛ, “Wec ji̱ Kɛɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil ram mi cuɛ päl a tëk, ciek kiɛ wut, mi dëë thok naŋ kä Gɛ̈th, a bɛ kɛ wä lat i̱, “Ci Dee-bid nɛmɛ la̱t.” Cuɛ nɔmɔ a lätdɛ kɛ pek ëë cieŋ kɛ jɛ rɛy ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu A-kic ɛ ŋäth ɛlɔ̱ŋ carɛ jɛ i̱, “Dee-bid ca lo̱k ɛlɔ̱ŋ ɛ nɛɛkɛ ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ba läätdä ni ciaŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
